          "comment": "# Comfy Higgsfield Genjutsu- Motion Transfer\n\nRecast an existing video with Higgsfield Genjutsu: the source clip keeps its motion, camera movement, timing and audio, while the cast, location and style are rebuilt from 1 to 8 reference images. Describe which reference replaces what in the optional prompt. Output length follows the source clip. Ideal for restyling footage, swapping the cast of a shot, and building scenes a shoot never covered. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_higgsfield_genjutsu_motion_transfer.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
